# Extra users and groups, in Buildroot "makeusers" syntax:
#   username uid group gid password home shell groups comment
# A username of "-" creates only the group; -1 picks a free id.
#
# systemd 258 udev rules give RTC and PTP devices to group "clock", which
# Buildroot 2026.02.3 does not create: without it udev logs a warning.
- -1 clock -1 * - - - Clock devices (RTC, PTP)
